<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>地方宣扬“个人是养老第一责任人”</b><br/><b>民众追问政府责任</b><br/><br/>山东省民政厅厅长10月16日在省政府老龄工作发布会上称，要“引导树立个人是养老第一责任人的观念”。视频片段在网上流传后，话题登上热搜。<br/><br/>有网民指政府推卸责任，并以80年代“只生一个好，国家来养老”的计划生育口号嘲讽；前《环球时报》总编辑胡锡进称，宣扬此说不合适，国家和社会也有责任。自由亚洲电台指出，六天前人社部提出以“数据找人”扩大参保，2025年社会保险基金若不计财政补贴，收支差额约1.45万亿元；受访学者认为，民政部门出面表态或在试探社会反应。<br/><br/>有中媒评论指出说法与以往官方表述并无根本不同，但企业和劳动者能否缴得起社保才是迫切问题，很多人“不是不想负责，是负不起”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BF%9D">#社保</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C">#山东</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>胡锡进：<a href="https://news.ifeng.com/c/8xIsa3wYk1T" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">有的地方宣扬“个人是养老第一责任人”，我觉得不合适</a><br/>《香港01》<a href="https://global.hk01.com/%E5%8D%B3%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/60401707/%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E5%80%A1-%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%85%BB%E8%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E4%BA%BA-%E6%83%B9%E8%AE%AE-%E8%83%A1%E9%94%A1%E8%BF%9B-%E8%A7%82%E6%84%9F%E4%BB%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%88%92%E6%9C%8D" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">山东倡“个人是养老第一责任人”惹议 胡锡进：观感令人不舒服</a><br/>《自由亚洲》<a href="https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/shehui/2026/10/21/china-elderly-care-ministry-of-human-resources-and-social-security-older-adults-social-security-funds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">官称养老先靠自己 民众追问政府责任</a><br/>《中国数字时代》<a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/733035.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">“个人是养老第一责任人”，现在就开始提了，是不是快了点？</a><br/>《搜狐》<a href="https://www.sohu.com/a/1089727060_665455" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">个人是养老第一责任人？戳到了很多人痛处</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/PTX-vR3rCeOytI1QSg5ynZd3pXhWPGrHhbzd9Yi8LkTDAkY_DS9rsZTVqnjjDTF9AqLQn7pbhfaiqZXjZjkxWJgeCTT8CWl8TN4uSRA-g7r8gQv1E1PBbDUJTHbb7dkRtUx-q-7aEaqfUla6TkWXPtlW8pUPrFaxyXvxM2il5yH9bVpBSx-1MgimkKmiPuZ3Qp0dcgHdzz1LDWrC86LvQnn6Yq4VmOeLIz8GM_L1fmyG7srdNFfdSjlV8rncgcMGeK9wGxDeYBfOicYAa-QLrVRI1wf0RqVu-q4gaRhjp9OPiGAyUxwbhyP3-H-RgGz2ROJhaWMZVYb7hnB5wrbEpw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/Rls4vZ32ctNwqHcOGga-kFUFrlGFEH6TN7iN3jK0vRUipSZxK-u8OuGe9Ltf596DLYfysOQLaNxJ9nElXxYELHCotUjCNXhjs_jSUfPNXsycNQ_3SRWDv5eqk00D4Rb7caQhMywUxvxr31mQ3xBJOdLazuu_6aWaDRLzT1daqnHvP3jvNh20TNdnVDfqfvqaRGJb0t4OR1DJeZZYl6NzyC8kH4lXnlN6FjgQYeQ4ZbFY_iGOsFo-paaIs5hvUUDq7NOEDRnROV0LEw5R43ChKx-nTwfNrPMH1noCBGMm0pkYhsTIxmS3v6D8RlKLf2EJz1iApjAWG2zJRwcMBSGh6g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/uEBeTppW5KUD2bMzRTzSDRRJM0RDCEtpeNerW7SRKDjpVEq2GuLjiqsTBqAi-aI49BUNRDrWs5KlSkET7o9jpiU-NjdQz3Lq425lN89-_Vg4OhnoQicYOKZbFbKmt4WCu6dJGRCtO5GCscWGroF_s27BmHUxiWQYEBPCX6-M1-gNRsuzAhAcwFDicUPWW1_uqU0jjhI31t6FxbCdME4QlH8pOVTCKvX9oBIt4lQ5AfquXbI4GYdqtLkDuH_WXZoLdZ09ahgqNFcI21Th45GkB_-P6sjtKYdlTAJYAi8aDlhpqfJSSPrWNeZdypjt7_F5g7FNgEmtaACgBD_e6gI4XQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/hPxVC6TjMQ5Wye5nnIwQMsGwOcYncA1Zdbq7POZRoUiNhbe_OVb_0Ja8sSt0A-iAUqSggf6-GY1C5RScY26vYpnbbzg83HDeGS1LAfJDBy4JbaLNzSA5kuDk9Na-SiiHyMJKucadp4csCx6AxODeTb2mNqWztxawGhPpdTdIouLXOGJM-OPQThSUdD8eyjT1fKswnnIAiTHa9G4peOVcS8rKScbyj4JsihOmYVwP6Bvs6P4mSOxNGEOl4udhRHXg2KnCWM922g-boQj_d2wsJkWsnfJF8xFazBBoYIxpltAAX1uKiQg7_1t3mD2MjXRS_2yt-yQk3Ofp9Y7E8epZGw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/f